{"v":3,"catch":"與惡魔一較高下！！","desc":"《LABYRINTH RUNNER》是KONAMI於1988年推出的射擊遊戲。\n為拯救遭綁架的芭芭雅公主，你將踏上前往邪惡惡魔盤踞之城堡的旅程。\n沿途需提防各種陷阱，並運用三種射擊彈幕，擊退從四面八方湧現的敵人！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2026-01-22","genres":["街機","射擊"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/33422f4be7697a47a4ca37911380145ad1bc036f5f80f84e563931709f864770.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/53f3dd21064509a870e1b9c9bae77b8b74ca10dd42b01035af133c2901e9a46e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/43bd318c81e92cd5c07d194c39fd485720e1b00166aaa2d8cdb113009ccc83b9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0c79029528dcccb5a63a44e0d2c37e8b5abc3f175084da9ff9b13f722d7211aa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/64d4e5568d3dc81d29fd5cee254bb4dbd0729a45995db0d0b69528d4aeff47be.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1766f762bfeaafe166d2198558608b91f907cccb24cc2b451cb1b512dd9462a5.jpg"],"titleId":"01002350263d4000","dlc":[]}